# Wordineer — Cloudflare Pages redirects
#
# Canonical URL shape: https://wordineer.com/page  (no .html, no trailing slash)
# Homepage is the only URL that keeps a trailing slash: https://wordineer.com/
#
# Cloudflare Pages already 308s /page/ and /page.html → /page when page.html exists.
# Do NOT add same-slug pairs like:
#   /page.html  /page/     301
#   /page/      /page.html 200
# Those fight the pretty-URL 308, create redirect chains, and teach Google the
# slash form (GSC "Page with redirect").
#
# This file is only for:
#   1. host / protocol
#   2. retired pages
#   3. old slugs that map to a *different* path
# Destinations are never trailing-slash except "/".
# First matching rule wins. Static rules before placeholders.

# Host / protocol
http://wordineer.com/*         https://wordineer.com/:splat         301
http://www.wordineer.com/*     https://wordineer.com/:splat         301
https://www.wordineer.com/*    https://wordineer.com/:splat         301

# Retired
/api                           /    301
/api/                          /    301
/api.html                      /    301

/blog                            /    301
/blog/                           /    301
/blog.html                       /    301

